{"a":[8,10],"h":"<p>Çünkü islâm gelmeden evvel o zaman için en son millet nasrâniyyet idi, o da teslisi kabul ediyordu 8.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"229\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 229.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 23.2 23.2 30.0 30.0 36.7 36.7 43.4 50.2 59.2 59.2 69.7 69.7 85.4 85.4 93.0 93.0 104.2 104.2 104.2 113.2 120.7 136.4 136.4 143.2 143.2 150.0 156.7 174.7 185.2 185.2 192.7 192.7 199.4 199.4 206.2\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"23.2 43.4 150.0 156.7 174.7 206.2 213.0\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> o zikir, ya'ni Allahın zikr-ü ıhtarını havi olan Kur'an aramızdan ona mı indirilmiş?<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"72\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 72.4 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 30.0 30.0 37.4 37.4 48.7 48.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"56.2\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> zikrim, ya'ni Kur'an <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"74\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 74.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 33.0 39.7 48.7\" y=\"25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"39.7 48.7 57.7\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> azâbî demektir, kesre ile yâdan iktifa olunmuştur. Ikabı, da böyledir. 11. </p>"}